{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a postman in a world of robots!</strong><br>Take on the role of an automated courier whose mission is to deliver important letters and help local residents along the way. But every delivery is more than just a route \u2014 it\u2019s a choice: will you rush to the next addressee or stop to lend a hand to those in need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore cities</strong><br>Each level is a maze of streets and houses. Find the right path through the stone jungles, overcome obstacles, and complete your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcec <strong>Unique challenges</strong><br>Every city hides its own special order. Solve puzzles, discover shortcuts, and make sure every letter reaches its destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Your story as a postman</strong><br>How you play determines what kind of postman you become \u2014 fast and efficient, or caring and helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the metal shoes of a robot postman and prove that even machines can deliver more than just letters \u2014 they can bring kindness.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LvL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946430/380b10c29822cc12956f3c885e303210b128ef82.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 1.1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946430/74dfa40f18299da9f996cf5476bc363bae14a4bd.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946430/c37e100db733100542a8d53399e0d200901a271e.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 2.2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946430/74dfa40f18299da9f996cf5476bc363bae14a4bd.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 2.3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946430/96a1eaff7c64d72e1d4beefbf01083635e3a96a1.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st